{
  "answer": "If the Payments Database goes down, the following services will be affected:\n\n**Direct Dependencies:**\n1. Payment Service - This service requires the Payments Database for all transaction storage.\n2. Fraud Detection Service - This service queries historical transactions from the Payments Database.\n\n**Cascade Dependencies:**\n3. API Gateway - This service routes payment requests to the Payment Service, which depends on the Payments Database.\n4. Checkout Service - This service processes payments through the Payment Service, which depends on the Payments Database.\n\nIn summary, the affected services are:\n- **Direct:** Payment Service, Fraud Detection Service\n- **Cascade:** API Gateway, Checkout Service",
